title: Track speculative messaging commitments and match dependencies at enactment
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Retain recent messaging commitments per parachain and expose the latest included
    root through the runtime API, excluding offboarding senders. Match dependencies
    at enactment against stored roots and candidates selected to enact together,
    including same-block dependencies and cycles.

    Unmatched candidates and their successors remain pending until they can enact
    or existing cleanup removes them. Account for recurring dependency selection
    and reserve its added cost before accepting new pending candidates.
crates:
- name: polkadot-runtime-parachains
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-primitives
  bump: major
